New: Wrong answers in multiple-choice mode now come from the same genus/family instead of randomly from the whole deck.
New: Watchlist button and language switch now also on the flashcard back.
New: After importing a deck, choose whether to download base, full, or no data.
Change: Missing photos/data during review now offer the right download directly.
Fix: Various small bug fixes.
Fix: The dialog for activating more cards stays open until the cards are ready.
Fix: Multiple choice becomes selectable as soon as the deck has enough species.
Fix: The online search now shows that it is running, and says when it found nothing either.
Fix: A failed online search can now be retried instead of silently disappearing.
Change: The attributes card on taxonomy pages now has a translated title.
Change: Entries that only come from the online search now say so, instead of promising reference data.
Fix: A single typed character shows the input hint instead of an endless loading spinner.
Fix: When the search fails while results are already on screen, it now says so instead of staying silent.
Fix: When the search fails with no results, the button to keep looking stays instead of being replaced by the error text.
Fix: The online search now says when it found nothing more, also when results are already on screen.
Fix: A deck with many cards due now shows its first card right away instead of after several seconds.
Fix: The watchlist shows its species right away; missing images appear as they finish loading.
Fix: Card images use much less memory, so flipping through cards runs smoother.
Fix: When editing a deck, the species list now also shows images that are already downloaded, instead of staying blank for some species.
